                <pb facs="0344" n="332" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg332"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.9491/20: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Minor</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-12T10:00:00+03:25">April 12, 1942—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>103. Prime Minister informs me he will notify Japanese Minister this afternoon
                    that his entire Legation must leave Iran without delay.</p>
                <p>Majlis in secret session April 8 approved expulsion of Japanese but with proviso
                    that consent of Russians be obtained. This unnecessary injection of Soviets into
                    picture was apparently another of the delaying tactics in which Iranians have
                    been indulging in this matter. When Soviet Ambassador refused to make formal
                    commitment in this regard British Minister made it clear to Prime Minister that
                    he considered conditional Majlis approval unsatisfactory. Prime Minister
                    therefore promises positive action today regardless of Soviet attitude. In view
                    of this development I shall refrain from delivering the note suggested in
                    Department’s No. 85, April 10, 2 p.m. unless Prime Minister fails to take the
                    promised action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minor</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
